        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as GraphDBClient (AnyLogic)\n    participant S as DBServer.acceptThread\n    participant P as clientPool\n    participant H as ClientHandler\n    participant T as CommandTranslator\n    participant G as GraphStorage\n\n    Note over C: первый execute — connect()\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: TCP connect\n    S-&gt;&gt;S: activeClients.add\n    S-&gt;&gt;P: submit(ClientHandler)\n    S--&gt;&gt;C: (accept returned)\n    P-&gt;&gt;H: run() — свободный поток\n    H-&gt;&gt;H: setSoTimeout(30min)\n\n    loop каждая команда\n        C-&gt;&gt;H: writeUTF(\&quot;ADD_NODE A\&quot;) + flush\n        H-&gt;&gt;T: execute(\&quot;ADD_NODE A\&quot;)\n        T-&gt;&gt;G: addNode(new Node(\&quot;A\&quot;))\n        G--&gt;&gt;T: (void)\n        T--&gt;&gt;H: \&quot;OK: node &#39;A&#39; added\&quot;\n        H--&gt;&gt;C: writeUTF(\&quot;OK: ...\&quot;) + flush\n    end\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;H: socket.close() (EOF)\n    H-&gt;&gt;H: EOFException → return\n    H-&gt;&gt;H: try-with-resources: socket.close()\n    H-&gt;&gt;S: finally: activeClients.remove\n    P--&gt;&gt;P: поток вернулся в пул&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="MEYWQ1dCJOU-GHOUTWcX-33">
